msgid "plugins.generic.quranVerifier.name"
msgstr "Quran & Hadith Citation Verifier"

msgid "plugins.generic.quranVerifier.description"
msgstr "Extracts Quranic quotations from manuscripts (Word/PDF incl. footnotes), verifies text and surah/verse references against the Mushaf, suggests corrections in Uthmani script, and flags incomplete hadith referencing. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah for Research and Studies."

