msgstr "Submissions & reports"

msgid "plugins.generic.quranVerifier.nav.tool"
msgstr "Quick check tool"

msgid "plugins.generic.quranVerifier.intro"
msgstr "The verifier checks every Quranic quotation in a manuscript: does the text match the Mushaf, and is the surah/verse reference correct? It also flags incomplete hadith referencing. It runs automatically on submission and can be run manually on any file."

